{"retcode":0,"message":"OK","data":{"page":{"id":"502486","name":"衍演纪行","desc":"4.7版本纪行 衍演纪行","icon_url":"https://act-upload.mihoyo.com/wiki-user-upload/2024/01/31/4521515/063017a5cd5cd43603f38f36940f4f80_4888731209196986687.png","header_img_url":"","modules":[{"name":"衍演纪行","is_poped":false,"components":[{"component_id":"collapse_panel","layout":"","data":"{\"rich_text\":\"\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"custom-image-view\\\" data-image-url=\\\"https://act-upload.mihoyo.com/wiki-user-upload/2024/09/18/288180982/df1f8813404cdcedd1172fc69d6ccd3d_4869735363361461743.png\\\" data-image-unit=\\\"px\\\" data-image-width=\\\"1067\\\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"custom-image-wrapper\\\" style=\\\"width: 1067px;\\\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\\\"\\\"\u003e\u003cimg class=\\\"custom-image\\\" src=\\\"https://act-upload.mihoyo.com/wiki-user-upload/2024/09/18/288180982/df1f8813404cdcedd1172fc69d6ccd3d_4869735363361461743.png\\\" style=\\\"width: 1067px;\\\"\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\",\"switch\":true,\"is_show_switch\":true,\"without_border\":false}\n","style":""}],"id":"1317","is_customize_name":true,"is_abstract":false,"is_show_switch":true,"switch":true,"desc":"","repeated":false,"is_submodule":false,"origin_module_id":"0","without_border":false,"can_delete":false,"is_hidden":false,"rich_text_editing":false},{"name":"纪行内容","is_poped":false,"components":[{"component_id":"collapse_panel","layout":"","data":"{\"rich_text\":\"\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\\\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51)\\\"\u003e活动期间，旅行者可以在纪行中获得丰厚的奖励，解锁「珍珠纪行」或「珍珠之歌」更可获得\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\\\"color: rgb(173, 114, 14)\\\"\u003e纠缠之缘与指定4星武器\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\\\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51)\\\"\u003e！直接购买珍珠之歌更可获得\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\\\"color: rgb(173, 114, 14)\\\"\u003e纪行专属名片「纪行·衍演」、纪行专属摆设图纸「机关模型-『标准调式』」。\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e〓活动时间〓\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\\\"color: rgb(173, 114, 14)\\\"\u003e4.7版本更新后 ~ 2024/07/15 03:59\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e〓参与条件〓\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\\\"color: rgb(173, 114, 14)\\\"\u003e冒险等阶≥20级\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e〓活动说明〓\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\\\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51)\\\"\u003e● 每期纪行活动开启后，大地纪行将默认解锁。旅行者还可通过解锁珍珠纪行或珍珠之歌，获取更丰厚的奖励。直接购买珍珠之歌将享受优惠。\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\\\"color: rgb(194, 84, 99)\\\"\u003e※已解锁珍珠纪行的旅行者，如有需要，可补充额外差价购买「纪行成歌」以解锁珍珠之歌。\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\\\"color: rgb(194, 84, 99)\\\"\u003e※2024/07/15 02:59将关闭本次纪行中珍珠纪行、珍珠之歌和纪行成歌的购买，购买关闭后旅行者仍可完成纪行任务并领取奖励，请旅行者留意纪行的购买和开放时间。\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\",\"switch\":true,\"is_show_switch\":true,\"without_border\":false}\n","style":""}],"id":"1318","is_customize_name":true,"is_abstract":false,"is_show_switch":true,"switch":true,"desc":"","repeated":false,"is_submodule":false,"origin_module_id":"0","without_border":false,"can_delete":false,"is_hidden":false,"rich_text_editing":false},{"name":"纪行奖励","is_poped":false,"components":[{"component_id":"collapse_panel","layout":"","data":"{\"rich_text\":\"\u003ctable class=\\\"tableWrapperContent\\\"\u003e\u003ctbody\u003e\u003ctr\u003e\u003ctd colspan=\\\"1\\\" rowspan=\\\"1\\\" style=\\\"\\\"\u003e\u003cp style=\\\"text-align: center\\\"\u003e等级\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\u003ctd colspan=\\\"1\\\" rowspan=\\\"1\\\" style=\\\"\\\"\u003e\u003cp style=\\\"text-align: center\\\"\u003e大地纪行\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\u003ctd colspan=\\\"1\\\" rowspan=\\\"1\\\" style=\\\"\\\"\u003e\u003cp style=\\\"text-align: center\\\"\u003e珍珠纪行\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\u003c/tr\u003e\u003ctr\u003e\u003ctd colspan=\\\"1\\\" rowspan=\\\"1\\\" style=\\\"\\\"\u003e\u003cp style=\\\"text-align: center\\\"\u003e1